<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan drains Y100 bln from market -- traders.</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan drains Y100 bln from market -- traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) drained a net 100 billion yen from the money market on Friday, money traders said.</p>
<p>Before the operation, the market was in net surplus by 200 billion yen.</p>
</text>
